{{ 'pham-campaign.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{%- capture state_raw -%}{%- render 'pham-campaign-state' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign state = state_raw | strip -%}

<section class="pham-campaign-shell" data-pham-edition-terms>
  <div class="pham-campaign-inner">
    {%- if state == 'prelaunch' -%}<span class="pham-campaign-draft">PRELAUNCH DRAFT · LEGAL REVIEW REQUIRED BEFORE PAYMENT GOES LIVE</span>{%- endif -%}
    <p class="pham-campaign-kicker">{{ settings.pham_campaign_edition_label | default: 'EDITION 01' }} · RESERVATION TERMS</p>
    <h1 class="pham-campaign-title">Edition<br>terms.</h1>
    <p class="pham-campaign-lede">Campaign-specific terms for the active edition. These terms operate alongside PHAM’s general Terms of Service, Privacy Policy and Refund Policy.</p>

    <div class="pham-campaign-grid">
      <article class="pham-campaign-card pham-campaign-card--full">
        <h2>1 · PHAM-001 jacket deposit</h2>
        <p>The {{ settings.pham_campaign_reservation_price | default: '$24.99' }} deposit is an initial payment toward one {{ settings.pham_campaign_final_price | default: '$199.00' }} PHAM-001 jacket, not a separate access fee. The deposit is credited to the jacket price. A confirmed deposit records an allocation subject to payment confirmation, edition capacity, fraud review and the final terms disclosed at checkout.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="pham-campaign-card pham-campaign-card--full">
        <h2>2 · Digital lookbook</h2>
        <p>{% if settings.pham_campaign_include_digital_lookbook %}After confirmed reservation payment, PHAM intends to deliver the {{ settings.pham_campaign_digital_lookbook_label | default: 'edition-exclusive digital lookbook' }} electronically. Checkout must obtain any consent required for immediate digital-content delivery. Delivery of digital content does not remove statutory cancellation, refund or consumer rights where applicable law provides otherwise.{% else %}No digital reservation benefit is currently configured for this edition.{% endif %}</p>
      </article>

      <article class="pham-campaign-card pham-campaign-card--full">
        <h2>3 · Remaining balance</h2>
        <p>When the acquisition window opens, a reserved collector is expected to receive a request for the remaining product balance of {{ settings.pham_campaign_balance_due | default: '$174.01' }}. Shipping, taxes and duties may be added at checkout according to destination and applicable rules. The planned payment window is {{ settings.pham_campaign_payment_window_hours | default: 72 }} hours. If the balance is not paid within the valid window, PHAM may release the allocation, subject to applicable law and the final published terms.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="pham-campaign-card pham-campaign-card--full">
        <h2>4 · Deposits, cancellations and refunds</h2>
        <p>The deposit is part of the jacket purchase price rather than an independent access fee. Conditions for cancellation, deposit refunds, production thresholds and non-payment of the remaining balance must be finalized and clearly disclosed before checkout opens. Customers retain mandatory cancellation and refund rights under applicable law. If PHAM cannot fulfill an order, it will provide the refund or other remedy required under the published terms and applicable law.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="pham-campaign-card pham-campaign-card--full">
        <h2>5 · Object Identity</h2>
        <p>Object Identity privileges are limited across both paid upgrades and referral unlocks. The paid Identity upgrade is a separate add-on and is not part of the reservation credit applied to the object price. Preferred object numbers are not final until server-side allocation confirms the number. Custom inscriptions remain subject to production constraints and PHAM content standards.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="pham-campaign-card pham-campaign-card--full">
        <h2>6 · Free standby</h2>
        <p>After paid reservations reach the edition allocation, further customers may join a free standby queue. A promoted standby customer pays the full {{ settings.pham_campaign_final_price | default: '$199.00' }} because no reservation credit was previously paid. Queue and offer-window rules are subject to the final campaign terms.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="pham-campaign-card pham-campaign-card--full">
        <h2>7 · Production and delivery record</h2>
        <p>After final acquisition is confirmed, the object may move through production, quality control, packing, dispatch and delivery stages shown in Collector Access. These stages are operational records, not guaranteed delivery dates. Carrier tracking controls the shipment estimate once the object is dispatched. Any published production or delivery estimate remains subject to the final order terms, destination, customs and events outside PHAM’s reasonable control.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="pham-campaign-card pham-campaign-card--full">
        <h2>8 · Founder’s Token</h2>
        <p>Edition 01 is intended to include 50 collector tokens: 49 silver-tone and one gold-tone finish. Token finish does not change ownership rights in the PHAM object and PHAM does not promise a resale, investment or cash value. The allocation mechanism and any related public promotion require final jurisdictional legal review before launch; where applicable law requires a different mechanism or disclosure, PHAM may amend this part of the edition protocol before reservations open.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

